<title>POLAND: Agros group Q2 net falls to PLN 16.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Agros group Q2 net falls to PLN 16.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agros group preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
